 ## Background
-The SVDAG parameter configurations were introduced to optimize the memory representation of voxelized 3D scenes using Sparse Voxel Directed Acyclic Graphs. The baseline SVO and SVDAG1 configurations follow the layout defined in reference [17] [S1]. The subsequent variants (SVDAG2–SVDAG6) were developed to explore the trade-offs between pointer length, addressing word size, and compression efficiency, leveraging the symmetry-aware node layout of SSVDAG [S1].
